WEBVTT

00:04:29.724 --> 00:04:31.642
and the lion's mane mushroom.

00:04:32.601 --> 00:04:36.605
We also looked deeply
into the field of soft robotics,

00:04:36.605 --> 00:04:42.486
and ultimately brought the aerobes to life
by designing them with fluid movement

00:04:42.486 --> 00:04:45.197
and lighter-than-air construction.

00:04:46.574 --> 00:04:48.492
When you look at these aerobes,

00:04:48.492 --> 00:04:53.039
it gives you a feeling almost opposite
to the uncanny valley.

00:04:54.165 --> 00:04:56.751
You know that they're mechanical,

00:04:56.792 --> 00:04:59.045
yet they feel palpably alive.

00:04:59.795 --> 00:05:04.133
You feel like you might be next
to some majestic and remote life-form.